<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">09</span> Contact <span class="line"></span></p>
  <h2>Let&rsquo;s build<br/>the <span class="ital">production</span> system.</h2>
  <p class="sub">
    AR Data takes a small number of engagements at a time. The discovery call
    is free, 30 minutes, and the fastest way to find out whether an agentic
    system is the right tool for your problem &mdash; or whether it isn&rsquo;t.
  </p>

  <div class="panel">
    <div>
      <div class="label">Book a call</div>
      <div class="big">30-minute AI partnership discovery.</div>
      <a class="big-cta" href="https://calendly.com/alvin-ardata/discovery-ai-partnership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Open Calendly <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="lines">
      <a href="https://twitter.com/alvinjayreyes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span>TWITTER &nbsp; /alvinjayreyes</span><span class="arr">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/alvin-reyes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span>GITHUB &nbsp; /alvin-reyes</span><span class="arr">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/alvinpreyes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span>LINKEDIN &nbsp; /alvinpreyes</span><span class="arr">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:alvin@ardata.tech">
        <span>EMAIL &nbsp; alvin@ardata.tech</span><span class="arr">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 120px);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .contact h2 .ital { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

  .contact .sub {
    max-width: 680px; color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.3vw, 20px); line-height: 1.55;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .contact .panel {
    margin-top: 56px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 36px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 36px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .contact .panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } }

  .contact .panel .label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .contact .panel .big {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .contact .panel a.big-cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .contact .panel a.big-cta:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); transform: translateY(-1px); color: var(--bg); }

  .contact .lines {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px;
    background: var(--rule);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact .lines a {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .contact .lines a:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
  .contact .lines a .arr { transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .contact .lines a:hover .arr { transform: translate(3px, -3px); }
</style>
